&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>不得不承认，消费降级也是一个大趋势。这是一个恶性循环：大家的消费越来越保守、降级，在直播间看到了低价，不会到品牌店铺买，不会到线下商超买；直播间利润太低甚至赔钱，商家想活下去，只能耍心眼，降品质，降分量，产品差了，恶评来了，品牌毁了。做不下去的时候，大量的库存卖到临期超市，消费者在临期超市看到了更便宜的产品，直播间也不去了。&lt;/p>
&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;a class="link" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bus_factor" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>Bus factor&lt;/a>
&lt;span style="white-space: nowrap;">&lt;svg width=".7em" height=".7em" viewBox="0 0 21 21"
xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
&lt;path d="m13 3l3.293 3.293l-7 7l1.414 1.414l7-7L21 11V3z" fill="currentColor" />
&lt;path d="M19 19H5V5h7l-2-2H5c-1.103 0-2 .897-2 2v14c0 1.103.897 2 2 2h14c1.103 0 2-.897 2-2v-5l-2-2v7z"
fill="currentColor">
&lt;/svg>&lt;/span>
&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>The &lt;strong>bus factor&lt;/strong> is a measurement of the &lt;a class="link" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Risk" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>risk&lt;/a>
&lt;span style="white-space: nowrap;">&lt;svg width=".7em" height=".7em" viewBox="0 0 21 21"
xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
&lt;path d="m13 3l3.293 3.293l-7 7l1.414 1.414l7-7L21 11V3z" fill="currentColor" />
&lt;path d="M19 19H5V5h7l-2-2H5c-1.103 0-2 .897-2 2v14c0 1.103.897 2 2 2h14c1.103 0 2-.897 2-2v-5l-2-2v7z"
fill="currentColor">
&lt;/svg>&lt;/span>
resulting from information and capabilities not being shared among team members, derived from the phrase &amp;ldquo;in case they get hit by a bus&amp;rdquo;. It is also known as the &lt;strong>bus problem&lt;/strong>, &lt;strong>truck factor&lt;/strong>, or &lt;strong>bus/truck number&lt;/strong>.&lt;/p>
&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>尼尔盖曼说的&lt;em>hit by a bus&lt;/em>，变成了更有典故的威胁（&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;a class="link" href="https://erikwernquist.com/one-revolution-per-minute" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>SHORT FILM: &amp;ldquo;ONE REVOLUTION PER MINUTE&amp;rdquo;&lt;/a>
&lt;span style="white-space: nowrap;">&lt;svg width=".7em" height=".7em" viewBox="0 0 21 21"
xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
&lt;path d="m13 3l3.293 3.293l-7 7l1.414 1.414l7-7L21 11V3z" fill="currentColor" />
&lt;path d="M19 19H5V5h7l-2-2H5c-1.103 0-2 .897-2 2v14c0 1.103.897 2 2 2h14c1.103 0 2-.897 2-2v-5l-2-2v7z"
fill="currentColor">
&lt;/svg>&lt;/span>
&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>每分钟一转：一个环形太空飞船以 1 RPM 的速度自转&lt;/p>
